"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "866127491612612"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3492089614386735"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "1311811552944751"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "762093205695609"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "706260171159026"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "542068508129936"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "855973592261113"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2362577837259164"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1585074611869932"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "694148775514128"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "650861409727224"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "153666661006355"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "212966368420687"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1732841194427355"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1797271200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2256632461943721"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29115175571458323", "version": "0.443.3_2026.11.24.21.51.47.534"}, "id": "2108450385907495", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1995434190525828", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29115175571458323"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2108450385907495"}]}, "change_log": "0.443.3\n\nimproved an avatar sdk model \nand also reduced the memory footprint of the app significantly", "created_date": 1795557438, "id": "29115175571458323", "version": "0.443.3_2026.11.24.21.51.47.534", "version_code": 217720307, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1995434190525828", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29115175571458323"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795555371, "id": "29114885701487310", "version": "0.443.2_2026.11.24.21.17.27.615", "version_code": 217718247, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1995434190525828", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29115175571458323"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2108450385907495"}]}, "change_log": "0.443.1\n\nA redesigned interface, new ways to practice, and improvements to performance, customization, and reliability.\n\n\u2022 Practice shots from replays: Pick a shot, loop it, practice against it, or add it to the Ball Machine. Switch your practice opponent between left- and right-handed play.\n\n\u2022 Redesigned menus: Easier navigation, clearer scoreboards, improved scrolling, contextual help, guided paddle calibration, and an avatar mirror in relevant settings screens.\n\n\u2022 More table customization: Switch tables in any environment, customize their appearance, and adjust net-tape and table-line smoothing. The STIGA Showcourt Sweden table is now available for purchase.\n\n\u2022 Explore other players\u2019 setups: View their paddles and rubber settings, copy rubbers into your own list, and explore Elo history charts directly in-game.\n\n\u2022 Less distracting pointers: New cursor-only mode replaces the laser with a small circle. Responsive side panels temporarily suppress pointer interaction while handling or hitting the ball, with an adjustable delay. Both options are available in advanced controller settings. You can also switch menu controllers without closing the menu.\n\n\u2022 Performance and visual improvements: Reduced unnecessary avatar processing, improved UI rendering efficiency, improved Mixed Reality table lighting, and fixed flickering and Arena\u2019s duplicate net. Automatic menu graphics boosting is now off by default.\n\n\u2022 More reliable replays: Uploads are verified before local cleanup, unfinished transfers retry across sessions, and replay practice/export positioning has been corrected.\n\n\u2022 Improved avatars: More reliable loading, better hand/grip alignment, and automatically refreshed profile photos with consistent lighting and poses. Choose how individual opponents appear to you using avatar or mask overrides.\n\n\u2022 Better match controls: Improved ranked matchmaking settings with estimated Elo gains/losses. The first player to ready up locks in match settings, with clearer mismatch messages. Custom room codes are easier to enter and find.\n\n\u2022 Equipment and reliability fixes: Corrected red/black rubber assignments, tutorial paddle saving, left-handed adapter positioning, and startup paddle collisions. Added advanced tracking reset controls and improved settings preservation.\n\n\u2022 Additional polish: Improved translations and font coverage, leaderboard and lobby fixes, clearer challenge errors, improved startup centering, better bug reporting, and persistent practice-panel visibility preferences.", "created_date": 1795545122, "id": "29113417501634130", "version": "0.443.1_2026.11.24.18.26.19.308", "version_code": 217707979, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1995434190525828", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29115175571458323"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795540746, "id": "29112759155033298", "version": "0.443.0_2026.11.24.17.14.1.289", "version_code": 217703641, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1995434190525828", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29115175571458323"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1795537442, "id": "29112222575086956", "version": "0.442.0_2026.11.24.16.18.48.329", "version_code": 217700328, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}